   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Week three. My draft is ready, and the pipeline runs. I compare the database with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the table. After lunch, I check continuous integration again. Before the meeting, I review GitHub Actions one more time. At that moment, Leo asks, \"What are you working on?\" I put the pattern into my own sentence: I'm working on ... I write down what I learned today.",
   "tts": "Week three. My draft is ready, and the pipeline runs. I compare the database with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the table. After lunch, I check continuous integration again. Before the meeting, I review Git Hub Actions one more time. At that moment, Leo asks, \"What are you working on?\" I put the pattern into my own sentence: I'm working on  I write down what I learned today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "第三周。我的草稿准备好了，流水线开始运行。我把数据库和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在数据表里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍持续集成。开会前，我又复习了一遍GitHub 自动化服务。这时，Leo问：\"你正在做什么？\"我把这个句型放进自己的句子里：我正在处理……我记下了今天学到的东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "database",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "数据库，按照结构长期保存和查询数据的系统"
    },
    {
