  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "At standup, I say what I finished and what is next. The team practises the pattern together: I've finished ... I use the pattern to ask a question: I'm blocked by ... After lunch, I check the row again. Before the meeting, I review the column one more time. The team talks about the workflow file at the standup. When I use the workflow run, I ask Maria for advice. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "tts": "At standup, I say what I finished and what is next. The team practises the pattern together: I've finished  I use the pattern to ask a question: I'm blocked by  After lunch, I check the row again. Before the meeting, I review the column one more time. The team talks about the workflow file at the standup. When I use the workflow run, I ask Maria for advice. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "站会上，我说了已完成的内容和下一步。团队一起练习这个句型：我已经完成……我用这个句型提了一个问题：我被……阻碍了。午饭后，我又检查了一遍行。开会前，我又复习了一遍列。团队在站会上讨论了工作流文件。使用工作流运行时，我向 Maria 请教。在团队的帮助下，问题变小了。",
   "hard": [
