  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. I compare the automated test with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the build pipeline. After lunch, I check the query again. Before the meeting, I review the database record one more time. Leo corrects my use of the pattern: My next step is ... At that moment, Priya says, \"I need more time.\" The automated tests pass. The team trusts the pipeline.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. I compare the automated test with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the build pipeline. After lunch, I check the query again. Before the meeting, I review the database record one more time. Leo corrects my use of the pattern: My next step is  At that moment, Priya says, \"I need more time.\" The automated tests pass. The team trusts the pipeline.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。我把自动化测试和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在构建流水线里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍查询。开会前，我又复习了一遍数据库记录。Leo 纠正了我对这个句型的用法：我的下一步是……这时，Priya说：\"我需要更多时间。\"自动化测试通过了。团队信任这条流水线。",
